message: >-
  If you use this software or its claim-evaluation rubric, please cite it as
  below. Documentation is licensed CC BY 4.0; code is licensed MIT.
title: "Ambient Superconductivity Lab"
abstract: >-
  A staged, provable, open platform toward the search for ambient-pressure,
  room-temperature superconductors, built to be a trustworthy tool for
  evaluating superconductivity claims. Every stage is checked by an automated
  proof, and predictions are preregistered before validation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Norman
    given-names: Aleksander
repository-code: "https://github.com/Normansrule/ambient-superconductivity-lab"
url: "https://normansrule.github.io/ambient-superconductivity-lab/"
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
keywords:
  - superconductivity
  - condensed matter physics
  - materials informatics
  - reproducibility
  - preregistration
